  "notes": "Cash basis, governmental funds only (no business-type funds). Beginning/ending cash are the Cash Basis Fund Balances the statement rolls forward (p4); ending 26,735,663 = cash and cash equivalents 26,629,751 + investments 105,912 (p3). Balance sheet from the governmental funds statement of cash basis assets and fund balances (p3), whose totals equal the Statement of Net Position (p1). Statement Taxes split by fund name (Inheritance Fund, Visitors Promotion/Improvement funds); statement Miscellaneous split using the Statement of Activities general receipts (Insurance Reimbursements, Keno Proceeds, Miscellaneous; p2), which add exactly to 1,144,457. Detail: General Fund and major funds from the budgetary comparison schedules (pp5-9; ARPA one-line disbursements split by the statement's function columns); 29 nonmajor funds from the combining statement Total column (pp17-21), more detailed than the one-line nonmajor budget schedules (pp10-16), which are not recorded to avoid double counting. Nonmajor Public Works 191,256 is entirely the Noxious Weed Fund (p21), so natural resources/conservation. Sinking Fund had no activity. Read pages 1-21 of 21"
}
